    "properties": [
      "Use Preferences.has to distinguish an absent session key from an existing value before every load or mutation snapshot.",
      "Use a unique get sentinel and reject present/get-sentinel disagreement, null, and non-string session values.",
      "Retain an exists/value snapshot before save or clear; stale mutations restore an existing value or delete and flush an originally absent key.",
      "Verify both the restored presence bit and value; poison further session access when rollback cannot be verified.",
      "Preserve tombstones, JSON validation, cross-page generation isolation, and the process-wide serialized session queue."
    ]
